{"5030670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Warehouse Catastrophe", "steam_appid": 5030670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/f5f7aa0210878e443bbaac8752265968.poster.avif?t=1788336204\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/f5f7aa0210878e443bbaac8752265968.webm?t=1788336204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/f5f7aa0210878e443bbaac8752265968.mp4?t=1788336204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything was perfect. All the packages were shelved in their designated areas, ready for delivery. You turned your back for just a couple of minutes, and your cat didn't miss the opportunity to sneak a sniff of some catnip...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this wasn't ordinary catnip. It was something new - military-grade catnip. Every cat in the neighborhood caught the scent...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven to find more, your one-brain-cell orange companion and his friends tore open every box, creating the biggest nightmare a delivery company could imagine. Now your boss is forcing you to fix the disaster by repacking every box with its correct contents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/ced3e65ca8d09e900b457fcdaa530baf.avif?t=1788336204\" width=800 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/0f7262beac8f8f7750095ae675348c5e.poster.avif?t=1788336204\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/0f7262beac8f8f7750095ae675348c5e.webm?t=1788336204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/0f7262beac8f8f7750095ae675348c5e.mp4?t=1788336204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about the joy of putting things back where they belong. Sort and repack <strong>4,170</strong> scattered products into <strong>1,415</strong> delivery boxes, transform a disaster-filled warehouse into a perfectly organized space, and try to keep up with the mischievous cat making your job even harder.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/f25e61eaaa396505c5317de9fa142c30.avif?t=1788336204\" width=800 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/2a7bd5d9fb4e1559fc41439b9efcb47e.poster.avif?t=1788336204\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/2a7bd5d9fb4e1559fc41439b9efcb47e.webm?t=1788336204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/2a7bd5d9fb4e1559fc41439b9efcb47e.mp4?t=1788336204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll unlock a sweet collection of tools, abilities, and power-ups that make every shift a little easier. Pull items back into boxes from across the room, quickly locate the products you need, pack boxes more efficiently, or sprinkle a calming catnip blend that turns even the wildest cats into sleepy little loaves. Every new unlock feels like a small reward for bringing order back to the warehouse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/5d192fb37d5e8034d1e9e570889449e4.avif?t=1788336204\" width=800 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/1fff36c72531629a1562c448f54faa3c.poster.avif?t=1788336204\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/1fff36c72531629a1562c448f54faa3c.webm?t=1788336204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/1fff36c72531629a1562c448f54faa3c.mp4?t=1788336204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your orange cat isn't the villain here - he's your biggest fan. He'll dig up items you thought were gone forever, cheer you on when you finish a row, and generally be the most emotionally supportive (or at least he tries) and most photogenic assistant a warehouse could ask for. Yes, he gets blamed for everything. No, he doesn't deserve it... probably.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/2ef1547e2189c52a1c3ec86c0e297e8c.avif?t=1788336204\" width=800 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧹 <strong>Satisfying chaos-to-order gameplay.</strong> <br>Turn wrecked, cluttered aisles into perfectly tidy rows, the kind of clean that just feels good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐈 <strong>A whole warehouse full of catnip-powered chaos.</strong> <br>Every night brings a bigger mess, more mischievous cats, and even more to organize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧡 <strong>One very good, very misunderstood orange cat.</strong> <br>He causes almost as much trouble as he solves, and he's impossible not to love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <strong>A charming little power tree.</strong> <br>Unlock delightful abilities like remote items-pulling and calming catnip to make cleanup a breeze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📸 <strong>Made for sharing.</strong> <br>Adorable cats, oddly satisfying tidying, and chaotic little moments perfect for clips and screenshots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pick up the mess. Clear your cat's name. Fall in love with the Cat-astrophe!</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/f5f7aa0210878e443bbaac8752265968.poster.avif?t=1788336204\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/f5f7aa0210878e443bbaac8752265968.webm?t=1788336204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/f5f7aa0210878e443bbaac8752265968.mp4?t=1788336204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything was perfect. All the packages were shelved in their designated areas, ready for delivery. You turned your back for just a couple of minutes, and your cat didn't miss the opportunity to sneak a sniff of some catnip...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But this wasn't ordinary catnip. It was something new - military-grade catnip. Every cat in the neighborhood caught the scent...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Driven to find more, your one-brain-cell orange companion and his friends tore open every box, creating the biggest nightmare a delivery company could imagine. Now your boss is forcing you to fix the disaster by repacking every box with its correct contents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/ced3e65ca8d09e900b457fcdaa530baf.avif?t=1788336204\" width=800 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/0f7262beac8f8f7750095ae675348c5e.poster.avif?t=1788336204\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/0f7262beac8f8f7750095ae675348c5e.webm?t=1788336204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/0f7262beac8f8f7750095ae675348c5e.mp4?t=1788336204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game about the joy of putting things back where they belong. Sort and repack <strong>4,170</strong> scattered products into <strong>1,415</strong> delivery boxes, transform a disaster-filled warehouse into a perfectly organized space, and try to keep up with the mischievous cat making your job even harder.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/f25e61eaaa396505c5317de9fa142c30.avif?t=1788336204\" width=800 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/2a7bd5d9fb4e1559fc41439b9efcb47e.poster.avif?t=1788336204\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/2a7bd5d9fb4e1559fc41439b9efcb47e.webm?t=1788336204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/2a7bd5d9fb4e1559fc41439b9efcb47e.mp4?t=1788336204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, you'll unlock a sweet collection of tools, abilities, and power-ups that make every shift a little easier. Pull items back into boxes from across the room, quickly locate the products you need, pack boxes more efficiently, or sprinkle a calming catnip blend that turns even the wildest cats into sleepy little loaves. Every new unlock feels like a small reward for bringing order back to the warehouse.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/5d192fb37d5e8034d1e9e570889449e4.avif?t=1788336204\" width=800 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/1fff36c72531629a1562c448f54faa3c.poster.avif?t=1788336204\" width=780 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/1fff36c72531629a1562c448f54faa3c.webm?t=1788336204\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/1fff36c72531629a1562c448f54faa3c.mp4?t=1788336204\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your orange cat isn't the villain here - he's your biggest fan. He'll dig up items you thought were gone forever, cheer you on when you finish a row, and generally be the most emotionally supportive (or at least he tries) and most photogenic assistant a warehouse could ask for. Yes, he gets blamed for everything. No, he doesn't deserve it... probably.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/extras/2ef1547e2189c52a1c3ec86c0e297e8c.avif?t=1788336204\" width=800 height=70 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧹 <strong>Satisfying chaos-to-order gameplay.</strong> <br>Turn wrecked, cluttered aisles into perfectly tidy rows, the kind of clean that just feels good.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐈 <strong>A whole warehouse full of catnip-powered chaos.</strong> <br>Every night brings a bigger mess, more mischievous cats, and even more to organize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧡 <strong>One very good, very misunderstood orange cat.</strong> <br>He causes almost as much trouble as he solves, and he's impossible not to love.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >✨ <strong>A charming little power tree.</strong> <br>Unlock delightful abilities like remote items-pulling and calming catnip to make cleanup a breeze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📸 <strong>Made for sharing.</strong> <br>Adorable cats, oddly satisfying tidying, and chaotic little moments perfect for clips and screenshots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Pick up the mess. Clear your cat's name. Fall in love with the Cat-astrophe!</i></p>", "short_description": "Warehouse: Catastrophe is a cozy warehouse organizing simulator where you clean, sort, and repack over 4,170 products into 1,415 delivery boxes. Restore a disaster-filled warehouse alongside your orange cat companion, unlock new abilities, and bring order back at your own relaxing pace.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/99e0506023aee8b4e0f363235c8615683becbbba/header.jpg?t=1788336204", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5030670/4468f235cb463ed6aa498699629756a9f31f594e/capsule_231x87.jp